          "char_shen_shang"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "ownership_history": [],
  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Dragon Whale Paradise, Shen Cong Sheng meets Chu Ying with a warm attitude. He says Heavenly Court gave him important information in exchange for Gu Yue Fang Zheng: this Dragon Whale Paradise has a rank eight response Immortal Gu, extremely important to him and Shen clan, which he has been looking for for many years. Shen clan is willing to cooperate. If Chu Ying sees this Gu on the Merit Obelisk’s reward list, Shen Cong Sheng hopes he will pass it. If he encounters this Gu in a mission, Shen clan would like him to capture it, and they will offer a huge reward.",
        "chapters": [
          1903
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_dragon_whale_paradise",
          "char_shen_cong_sheng",
          "fac_heavenly_court",
          "char_fang_zheng",
          "fac_shen_clan",
          "house_merit_obelisk"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan names Response Gu. He states that this Gu worm is among the top ten of the List of Mystical Gu, that it can emit a voice, and that anyone who hears this voice and responds to it will become enslaved. A rank eight response Gu can enslave rank eight Gu Immortals. He calls it a precious Gu that Shen clan is unable to obtain, and asks what rewards they are offering, since within Dragon Whale Paradise they cannot set an agreement. Shen Cong Sheng offers a set of immortal materials as a portion of sincerity, which Fang Yuan accepts. Shen Cong Sheng adds that response Gu might be in the super immortal formation set by Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable, and that even if it is not there, Shen clan Gu Immortals can lend a hand. Fang Yuan agrees to receive that help.",
        "chapters": [
          1903
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
